'''Kyūshi Kasei''' (九紫火星) is one of the {{ill|Nine Stars|ja|九星|12=draft}} used in {{ill|calendars|ja|暦|12=draft}} and {{ill|fortune-telling|ja|占い|12=draft}}. In the Post-Heaven Lo Shu Square, it occupies the southern position.
Among the Nine Stars, it is the only one associated with the Fire element in the {{ill|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|lt=Wuxing|ja|五行思想|12=draft}}.
In the daily cycle of the Nine Stars, the day closest to the {{ill|summer solstice|ja|夏至|12=draft}} that falls on a Kanoto (甲子) day is designated as Kyūshi, marking the transition from Yang to Yin. At that time, the last day of the previous Yang cycle and the first day of the new Yin cycle both belong to Kyūshi, making it appear for two consecutive days.
== Attributes == * {{ill|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|lt=Wuxing|ja|五行思想|12=draft}} - Fire * {{ill|Bagua|ja|八卦|12=draft}} - Li (離) * {{ill|Heavenly Stems|lt=Ten Heavenly Stems|ja|十干|12=draft}} - Bing (丙), Ding (丁) * {{ill|Earthly Branches|lt=Twelve Earthly Branches|ja|十二支|12=draft}} - Wu (午) * Season - Summer * Direction - South * Month - {{ill|June|ja|6月|12=draft}} * Time - 11:00–13:00 * Number - Two, Seven * Color - Red * Taste - Bitter
== Symbolic Meanings == * Separation and reunion, divinity, nobility, glamorous beauty, strong-willed middle-aged women, weddings, divorces, purple smoke, shadows, fires, high blood pressure, heart disease, brain disorders, vanity, embellishment, conflict * Documents, fire, scholars, heat, light, brilliance, glory, bitterness, spirit, withdrawal, severance, destruction, revelation, eye diseases, intellect, vision, blood cells, face, head
== Relationships with Other Stars == * Generating Cycle (相生) - {{ill|Nikoku Dosei|ja|二黒土星|1=Second Black Earth Star|12=draft}} (Fire generates Earth), {{ill|Sanpeki Mokusei|ja|三碧木星|1=Third Blue Wood Star|12=draft}} (Wood generates Fire), {{ill|Shiroku Mokusei|ja|四緑木星|1=Fourth Green Wood Star|12=draft}} (Wood generates Fire), {{ill|Goō Dosei|1=Fifth Yellow Earth Star|ja|五黄土星|12=draft}} (Fire generates Earth), {{ill|Happaku Dosei|1=Eighth White Earth Star|ja|八白土星|12=draft}} (Fire generates Earth) * Overcoming Cycle (相克) - {{ill|Ippaku Suisei|ja|一白水星|1=First White Water Star|12=draft}} (Water overcomes Fire), {{ill|Roppaku Kinsei|1=Sixth White Metal Star|ja|六白金星|12=draft}} (Fire overcomes Metal), {{ill|Shichiseki Kinsei|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星|12=draft}} (Fire overcomes Metal) * Harmonious Relationship (比和) - Kyūshi Kasei
== Years in Which Kyūshi Kasei Occupies the Center == Years in which the remainder when divided by 9 is 2 are Kyūshi Kasei years.
‥‥ - [[1928]] - [[1937]] - [[1946]] - [[1955]] - [[1964]] - [[1973]] - [[
