* Harmonious Relationship (比和) - Kyūshi Kasei

== Years in Which Kyūshi Kasei Occupies the Center ==
Years in which the remainder when divided by 9 is 2 are Kyūshi Kasei years.

‥‥ - [[1928]] - [[1937]] - [[1946]] - [[1955]] - [[1964]] - [[1973]] - [[

